(P116 - Pen up to the GP2 lift-home switch, then park off the bed.)
(Manual operator command for the converter's end-of-print clear -> full retract -> G53 park.)
(Intended for an ioSender button named PEN UP + PARK, confirmation enabled, issuing G65 P116.)
(This macro never homes: run it from IDLE with a known machine position. Its text also)
(contains no dollar-command at all, so no system command can execute while it streams.)
(It requires the installed Aux0/GP28 path - M65 asserts the arm, M64 releases it - and the)
(toolhead M5 clearance plus disarmed-Aux0 full-retract behaviour.)

(Self-contained modal and frame setup, matching the converter program preamble.)
G21
G90
G94
G17
G54

(1. Normal pen-up, then prove the pen actually left the paper before any gantry move.)
(Q0 accepts an already-clear level or waits for clear-ready; a stuck or faulted toolhead)
(raises error 39 and stops here, so the park move is never attempted from contact.)
M5
G65 P115 Q0
(A controller without the installed P115.macro substitutes the converter's pen-up dwell:)
(G4 P0.8. That only bounds the clearance; it does not prove it.)

(2. Request the full retract to the GP2 lift-home switch through the Aux0/GP28 arm.)
(Release the arm first so the following assertion is a clean rising edge even if an)
(earlier attempt aborted between M65 and M64. While the magnetic path is DISARMED and)
(the pen is off GP2, the arm rising edge is an end-of-print full-retract request, not a)
(magnetic scan, so this cannot start a P100 raster.)
M64 P0
G4 P0.20
M65 P0
(3.0 s is the toolhead's own full-retract bound (BOOT_LIFT_TIME_MS). It reports)
(GP2 lift-home not reached during retract instead of retracting without a limit.)
G4 P3.0
M64 P0

(3. Park off the bed at the homed rest position in machine coordinates.)
(This is the converter's default park target; keep it inside the controller's)
(soft-limit envelope, settings 130 and 131.)
(The pen is already proven clear, so this move cannot drag it across the sheet.)
G53 G0 X-10 Y-436
(print,P116 pen-up-to-lift-home and park complete)
o1161 return [1]
